const nav=[['课程总览','overview'],['教学大纲','syllabus'],['教学日历','calendar'],['备课工作台','preparation'],['课件制作','courseware'],['作业管理','assignment'],['学生画像','students'],['试卷管理','exam']];
const stat=(l,v,s)=>`<div class="stat"><span>${l}</span><strong>${v}</strong><em>${s}</em></div>`;const todo=(t,m,ok=false)=>`<div class="todo"><i class="${ok?'ok':''}"></i><div><b>${t}</b><small>${m}</small></div><span class="tag ${ok?'ok':''}">${ok?'查看':'处理'}</span></div>`;const table=(heads,rows)=>`<table class="table"><thead><tr>${heads.map(x=>`<th>${x}</th>`).join('')}</tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(r=>`<tr>${r.map((x,i)=>`<td>${i===0?'<b>'+x+'</b>':x}</td>`).join('')}</tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table>`;
function side(active){return `<aside class="side"><button class="back" onclick="location.hash='#courses'">← 我的课程</button><p class="label">课程工作空间</p>${nav.map(([t,k])=>`<a href="#course/${k}" class="${active===k?'active':''}" ${k==='courseware'?'onclick="window.cwResetToHome?.()"':''}>◈　${t}</a>`).join('')}<div class="foot"><span class="dot"></span>Mock 数据模式<br><small>课程负责人视图</small></div></aside>`}function shell(content,active){return `<div class="layout">${side(active)}<main class="main"><div class="context"><div><span class="eyebrow">当前课程</span><strong>离散数学</strong><span>2026 秋季 · v3 当前有效</span></div><button class="btn secondary">切换课程⌄</button></div>${content}</main></div>`}
function home(){return `<main class="global-main"><div class="eyebrow">AI教务系统 / HOME</div><div class="title-row"><div><h1>早上好，林老师</h1><p class="muted">今天是 2026 年 9 月 4 日，先处理最重要的教学任务。</p></div><span class="muted">本周第 3 周 · 课程负责人视图</span></div><div class="stats">${stat('进行中课程','3','含 1 门待归档')}${stat('待处理事项','5','2 项即将逾期')}${stat('AI 任务中','2','1 个排队中')}${stat('课程资料','28','份可用资料')}</div><div class="grid"><section class="panel"><div class="head"><h2>我的课程</h2><a>查看全部 →</a></div><div class="cards">${['离散数学','数据结构','算法设计','数据库原理'].map((x,i)=>`<div class="course"><b>${x}</b><span>2026 秋季 · ${i?'任课教师':'课程负责人'}</span><small>${i===3?'已归档':'v'+(i+1)+' 当前有效'} · 最近访问</small></div>`).join('')}</div></section><section class="panel"><div class="head"><h2>待办事项</h2><a href="#notifications">消息提醒 →</a></div>${todo('教学日历 v3 待审核','截止今天 · 离散数学')}${todo('成绩导入存在 warning','46 / 50 条记录已通过')}${todo('第 4 章备课草稿','离散数学 · 2 小时前',true)}</section></div><div class="grid"><section class="panel"><div class="head"><h2>异步任务</h2><a>任务中心 →</a></div><div class="task"><div><b>第 3 章资料摘要</b><small>AI 生成 · 离散数学</small></div><div class="taskbar"><i style="width:72%"></i></div><span>72%</span></div><div class="task"><div><b>章节例题集解析</b><small>文件处理 · 离散数学</small></div><div class="taskbar"><i style="width:24%;background:#bfc9cc"></i></div><span class="muted">排队</span></div><div class="task"><div><b>学情摘要生成</b><small>AI 生成 · 数据结构</small></div><div class="taskbar"><i class="fail" style="width:100%"></i></div><span style="color:var(--danger)">失败</span></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="head"><h2>最近使用</h2><a>查看记录 →</a></div>${todo('第 4 章 · 图论','离散数学 · 10 分钟前',true)}${todo('教学大纲 v2','数据结构 · 昨天 16:20',true)}${todo('成绩明细','算法设计 · 9 月 2 日',true)}</section></div><section class="panel"><div class="head"><h2>快捷操作</h2><span class="muted">将进入对应流程</span></div><div class="quick"><button><b>＋ 创建课程</b><span>上传主教材并建立课程版本</span></button><button onclick="location.hash='#materials'"><b>↥ 上传资料</b><span>选择课程与资料归属</span></button><button onclick="location.hash='#course/syllabus'"><b>✦ 生成大纲</b><span>从主教材生成结构化草稿</span></button><button onclick="location.hash='#course/students'"><b>⇧ 导入成绩</b><span>导入并校验成绩文件</span></button></div></section></main>`}
function courses(){return '<main class="global-main"><div class="eyebrow">我的课程 / COURSES</div><div class="title-row"><div><h1>课程管理（<span id="courseCount" class="title-count">4</span>）</h1></div><button class="btn primary" onclick="openCourseCreate()">＋ 创建课程</button></div><section class="course-filter global-card"><div class="filter-toolbar"><div class="filter-line"><label>搜索课程<input id="courseKeyword" placeholder="课程名称 / 课程编号"></label><label>学年<select id="courseYear"><option value="">全部学年</option><option>2026</option><option>2025</option></select></label><label>学期<select id="courseTerm"><option value="">全部学期</option><option value="spring">春季</option><option value="summer">夏季</option><option value="autumn">秋季</option><option value="winter">冬季</option></select></label><label>课程状态<select id="courseStatus"><option value="">全部状态</option><option value="active">可使用</option><option value="draft">草稿</option><option value="processing">资料处理中</option><option value="pending_review">待确认</option><option value="has_todo">有待处理事项</option><option value="archived">已归档</option></select></label><button class="btn secondary" onclick="filterCourses()">筛选</button><button class="btn secondary" onclick="resetCourses()">重置</button></div><div class="sort-line"><label>排序<select id="courseSort"><option value="updated_at">最近更新</option><option value="created_at">创建时间</option><option value="name">名称</option></select></label></div></div></section><div id="courseCards" class="course-grid"><article class="course-tile global-card" data-name="离散数学" data-year="2026" data-term="autumn" data-status="active" role="link" tabindex="0" onclick="location.hash=&quot;#course/overview&quot;" onkeydown="if(event.key===&quot;Enter&quot;||event.key===&quot; &quot;)location.hash=&quot;#course/overview&quot;"><div class="tile-top"><span class="muted">MATH203</span><span class="tag ok">可使用</span></div><h2>离散数学</h2><p>2026 秋季　·　课程负责人：林老师</p><div class="tile-meta"><span>版本 v3</span><span>待办 2</span></div><button class="btn secondary" onclick="location.hash=\'#course/overview\'">进入课程 →</button></article><article class="course-tile global-card" data-name="数据结构" data-year="2026" data-term="autumn" data-status="active" role="link" tabindex="0" onclick="location.hash=&quot;#course/overview&quot;" onkeydown="if(event.key===&quot;Enter&quot;||event.key===&quot; &quot;)location.hash=&quot;#course/overview&quot;"><div class="tile-top"><span class="muted">CS201</span><span class="tag ok">可使用</span></div><h2>数据结构</h2><p>2026 秋季　·　任课教师：王老师</p><div class="tile-meta"><span>版本 v1</span><span>待办 0</span></div><button class="btn secondary" onclick="location.hash=\'#course/overview\'">进入课程 →</button></article><article class="course-tile global-card" data-name="算法设计" data-year="2026" data-term="autumn" data-status="active" role="link" tabindex="0" onclick="location.hash=&quot;#course/overview&quot;" onkeydown="if(event.key===&quot;Enter&quot;||event.key===&quot; &quot;)location.hash=&quot;#course/overview&quot;"><div class="tile-top"><span class="muted">CS305</span><span class="tag ok">可使用</span></div><h2>算法设计</h2><p>2026 秋季　·　任课教师：王老师</p><div class="tile-meta"><span>版本 v2</span><span>待办 0</span></div><button class="btn secondary" onclick="location.hash=\'#course/overview\'">进入课程 →</button></article><article class="course-tile global-card" data-name="数据库原理" data-year="2025" data-term="autumn" data-status="archived" role="link" tabindex="0" onclick="location.hash=&quot;#course/overview&quot;" onkeydown="if(event.key===&quot;Enter&quot;||event.key===&quot; &quot;)location.hash=&quot;#course/overview&quot;"><div class="tile-top"><span class="muted">CS202</span><span class="tag gray">已归档</span></div><h2>数据库原理</h2><p>2025 秋季　·　课程负责人：林老师</p><div class="tile-meta"><span>版本 v2</span><span>待办 0</span></div><button class="btn secondary" onclick="location.hash=\'#course/overview\'">查看课程 →</button></article></div><div id="courseEmpty" class="empty" style="display:none"><h2>没有找到匹配课程</h2><p>尝试调整筛选条件，或创建一门新课程。</p><button class="btn primary" onclick="openCourseCreate()">创建课程</button></div></main>'}
/* Materials is intentionally self-contained: its state, markup and events stay scoped to this route. */
const materialSeed={personal:[{id:'discrete',name:'离散数学',count:4,files:[{name:'离散数学教材.pdf',type:'pdf',size:'24.8 MB',meta:'主教材 · 2026 秋季',updated:'今天 09:42',status:'available'}]},{id:'teaching',name:'教学设计',count:3,files:[{name:'第 3 章例题集.pptx',type:'pptx',size:'8.4 MB',meta:'课堂资料',updated:'昨天 16:20',status:'available'},{name:'课程思政案例.docx',type:'docx',size:'1.2 MB',meta:'教学参考',updated:'9 月 2 日',status:'available'}]},{id:'research',name:'研究与灵感',count:2,files:[]}],shared:[{id:'shared-course',name:'课程共享资料',count:6,files:[{name:'2026 秋季教学日历模板.docx',type:'docx',size:'426 KB',meta:'罗文秋 · 共享给课程组',updated:'9 月 3 日',status:'available'},{name:'图论案例视频链接.url',type:'link',size:'—',meta:'王老师 · 课程共享',updated:'8 月 28 日',status:'available'}]},{id:'shared-school',name:'学校模板',count:12,files:[{name:'本科课程教学大纲模板.docx',type:'docx',size:'2.1 MB',meta:'教务处 · 全校共享',updated:'8 月 18 日',status:'available'}]}]};
let materialState={scope:'personal',folderId:'discrete',selected:null,search:''};
function materialIcon(type='file'){const paths={folder:'<path d="M3.5 6.5h5l1.7 2h10.3v9.8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-15a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8.5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Z"/><path d="M2 9h18.5"/>',search:'<circle cx="10.8" cy="10.8" r="6.2"/><path d="m16 16 4.2 4.2"/>',upload:'<path d="M12 16V4.5M7.5 9 12 4.5 16.5 9M5 14.5v4.2h14v-4.2"/>',pdf:'<path d="M6 2.8h8l4 4v14.4H6z"/><path d="M14 2.8v4h4M8.5 15h2.1a1.4 1.4 0 0 0 0-2.8H8.5v5.6M13 17.8v-5.6h1.8a2.8 2.8 0 0 1 0 5.6H13Z"/>',pptx:'<path d="M5 2.8h9l4 4v14.4H5z"/><path d="M14 2.8v4h4M8 17v-5.2h3.2a1.7 1.7 0 1 1 0 3.4H8m0 0h4"/>',docx:'<path d="M6 2.8h8l4 4v14.4H6z"/><path d="M14 2.8v4h4M9 12h6M9 15h6M9 18h4"/>',link:'<path d="M9.5 14.5 8 16a3.2 3.2 0 0 1-4.5-4.5l2.2-2.2a3.2 3.2 0 0 1 4.5 0M14.5 9.5 16 8a3.2 3.2 0 0 1 4.5 4.5l-2.2 2.2a3.2 3.2 0 0 1-4.5 0M8 16l8-8"/>'};return `<svg class="ml-icon ml-icon-${type}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">${paths[type]||paths.docx}</svg>`}
function materialAllFolders(){const extra=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('ml-folders')||'[]');return {personal:[...materialSeed.personal,...extra],shared:materialSeed.shared}}
function materialFindFolder(){return materialAllFolders()[materialState.scope].find(f=>f.id===materialState.folderId)||materialAllFolders()[materialState.scope][0]}
function renderMaterialTree(){const all=materialAllFolders();return `<div class="ml-tree-group"><div class="ml-tree-title"><span>个人知识库</span><button class="ml-tree-add" title="新建知识文件夹" onclick="materialNewFolder()">＋</button></div>${all.personal.map(f=>`<button class="ml-tree-item ${materialState.scope==='personal'&&materialState.folderId===f.id?'is-active':''}" onclick="materialSelectFolder('personal','${f.id}')">${materialIcon('folder')}<span>${f.name}</span><em>${f.files.length}</em></button>`).join('')}</div><div class="ml-tree-group ml-tree-group-shared"><div class="ml-tree-title"><span>共享知识库</span><span class="ml-lock">只读</span></div>${all.shared.map(f=>`<button class="ml-tree-item ${materialState.scope==='shared'&&materialState.folderId===f.id?'is-active':''}" onclick="materialSelectFolder('shared','${f.id}')">${materialIcon('folder')}<span>${f.name}</span><em>${f.files.length}</em></button>`).join('')}</div>`}
function materials(){const folder=materialFindFolder();const files=(folder?.files||[]).filter(f=>!materialState.search||f.name.toLowerCase().includes(materialState.search.toLowerCase()));const isShared=materialState.scope==='shared';return `<main class="global-main materials-page"><div class="ml-page-head"><div><div class="ml-breadcrumb"><span>资料库</span><b>/</b><span>${isShared?'共享知识库':'个人知识库'}</span></div><h1>我的资料库</h1><p>把课程资料收进知识文件夹，随时查找、预览与复用。</p></div><div class="ml-head-actions"><label class="ml-search"><span>${materialIcon('search')}</span><input value="${materialState.search}" oninput="materialSearch(this.value)" placeholder="搜索资料名称" aria-label="搜索资料名称"></label><button class="btn primary ml-upload-head" ${isShared?'disabled':''} onclick="materialTriggerUpload()">${materialIcon('upload')}上传资料<input id="materialFileInput" type="file" hidden multiple onchange="materialUpload(this.files)"></button></div></div><div class="ml-workspace"><aside class="ml-sidebar"><div class="ml-sidebar-head"><div><span class="ml-sidebar-kicker">KNOWLEDGE SPACE</span><strong>知识空间</strong></div><button class="ml-collapse" aria-label="收起目录">‹</button></div><div id="materialTree" class="ml-tree">${renderMaterialTree()}</div><div class="ml-sidebar-foot"><div class="ml-storage"><span>存储使用</span><b>1.2 GB <small>/ 10 GB</small></b><i><em></em></i></div><span>最后同步 · 刚刚</span></div></aside><section class="ml-content"><div class="ml-content-head"><div class="ml-folder-title"><div class="ml-folder-mark">${materialIcon('folder')}</div><div><div class="ml-folder-kicker">${isShared?'共享知识库':'个人知识库'}</div><h2>${folder?.name||'未命名文件夹'}</h2><span>${folder?.files.length||0} 份资料 · ${isShared?'课程组成员可查看':'仅自己可见'}</span></div></div><div class="ml-folder-actions"><button class="ml-ghost-btn" onclick="materialSort(this)">最近更新 <span>⌄</span></button><button class="ml-ghost-btn" ${isShared?'disabled':''} onclick="materialTriggerUpload()">${materialIcon('upload')}添加资料</button></div></div><div class="ml-info-strip"><div><span class="ml-info-icon">✦</span><span><b>知识文件夹</b>　资料会按文件夹自动归档，支持 PDF、Word、PPT 和链接。</span></div><button onclick="this.parentElement.remove()" aria-label="关闭提示">×</button></div>${files.length?`<div class="ml-file-list">${files.map((f,i)=>`<article class="ml-file-row ${materialState.selected===f.name?'is-selected':''}" onclick="materialSelectFile('${f.name.replace(/'/g,"\\'")}')"><div class="ml-file-icon type-${f.type}">${materialIcon(f.type)}</div><div class="ml-file-main"><b>${f.name}</b><span>${f.meta}</span></div><div class="ml-file-size">${f.size}</div><div class="ml-file-status"><span class="ml-status-dot ${f.status==='processing'?'is-processing':''}"></span>${f.status==='processing'?'解析中':'可用'}</div><span class="ml-file-date">${f.updated}</span><button class="ml-more" onclick="event.stopPropagation();materialMore('${f.name.replace(/'/g,"\\'")}')" aria-label="更多操作">•••</button></article>`).join('')}</div>`:`<div class="ml-empty"><div class="ml-empty-orbit">${materialIcon('folder')}</div><h3>${materialState.search?'没有找到匹配资料':'这个文件夹还没有资料'}</h3><p>${materialState.search?'换个关键词试试，或清空搜索。':'上传第一份资料，建立你的知识空间。'}</p>${materialState.search?'<button class="ml-text-btn" onclick="materialSearch(\'\')">清空搜索</button>':(isShared?'':'<button class="btn primary" onclick="materialTriggerUpload()">'+materialIcon('upload')+'上传资料</button>')}</div>`}<div class="ml-content-footer"><span>共 ${files.length} 份${materialState.search?'匹配资料':''}</span><span>支持拖拽上传 · 单个文件最大 500 MB</span></div></section></div></main>`}
function materialRerender(){const app=document.getElementById('app');if(app)app.innerHTML=materials()}
function materialSelectFolder(scope,id){materialState.scope=scope;materialState.folderId=id;materialState.selected=null;materialState.search='';materialRerender()}
function materialSearch(value){materialState.search=value;materialRerender();const input=document.querySelector('.ml-search input');if(input){input.focus();input.setSelectionRange(value.length,value.length)}}
function materialTriggerUpload(){const input=document.getElementById('materialFileInput');if(input)input.click()}
function materialUpload(fileList){const folder=materialFindFolder();if(!folder||materialState.scope==='shared'||!fileList?.length)return;Array.from(fileList).forEach((file,index)=>{folder.files.unshift({name:file.name,type:(file.name.split('.').pop()||'file').toLowerCase(),size:file.size>1048576?(file.size/1048576).toFixed(1)+' MB':Math.max(1,Math.round(file.size/1024))+' KB',meta:'刚刚上传 · 待解析',updated:'刚刚',status:'processing'});});materialSeed.personal.forEach(f=>{if(f.id===folder.id)f.files=folder.files});const extra=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('ml-folders')||'[]');const ei=extra.findIndex(f=>f.id===folder.id);if(ei>=0){extra[ei]=folder;localStorage.setItem('ml-folders',JSON.stringify(extra))}materialRerender();setTimeout(()=>{folder.files.forEach(f=>{if(f.status==='processing'){f.status='available';f.meta='个人资料 · 已完成解析';f.updated='刚刚'}});materialRerender()},1100)}
function materialNewFolder(){if(document.querySelector('.ml-dialog-backdrop'))return;const backdrop=document.createElement('div');backdrop.className='ml-dialog-backdrop';backdrop.innerHTML='<div class="ml-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="mlDialogTitle"><button class="ml-dialog-close" onclick="materialCloseFolderDialog()" aria-label="关闭">×</button><span class="ml-dialog-kicker">PERSONAL KNOWLEDGE BASE</span><h3 id="mlDialogTitle">新建知识文件夹</h3><p>给你的资料空间起一个清晰的名字，之后可以在里面持续收集文件。</p><label>文件夹名称<input id="mlFolderName" maxlength="24" placeholder="例如：课程备课" autofocus></label><div class="ml-dialog-actions"><button class="ml-ghost-btn" onclick="materialCloseFolderDialog()">取消</button><button class="btn primary" onclick="materialCommitFolder()">创建文件夹</button></div></div>';backdrop.addEventListener('click',event=>{if(event.target===backdrop)materialCloseFolderDialog()});document.body.appendChild(backdrop);setTimeout(()=>document.getElementById('mlFolderName')?.focus(),0)}
function materialCloseFolderDialog(){document.querySelector('.ml-dialog-backdrop')?.remove()}
function materialCommitFolder(){const input=document.getElementById('mlFolderName');const name=input?.value.trim();if(!name){input?.focus();return}const folder={id:'custom-'+Date.now(),name:name.slice(0,24),count:0,files:[]};const extra=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('ml-folders')||'[]');extra.push(folder);localStorage.setItem('ml-folders',JSON.stringify(extra));materialState.scope='personal';materialState.folderId=folder.id;materialState.selected=null;materialCloseFolderDialog();materialRerender()}
function materialSelectFile(name){materialState.selected=name;materialRerender()}
function materialMore(name){window.alert(`${name}\n\n预览、下载、移动到其他文件夹等操作将在正式版本中开放。`)}
function materialSort(button){const folder=materialFindFolder();if(!folder)return;folder.files.reverse();button.innerHTML='名称排序 <span>⌄</span>';materialRerender()}
function notifications(){return `<main class="global-main"><div class="eyebrow">消息提醒 / NOTIFICATIONS</div><div class="title-row"><div><h1>消息提醒</h1><p class="muted">审核、解析、AI 任务状态会同步到这里</p></div><button class="btn secondary" onclick="this.textContent='已全部读'">全部标为已读</button></div><section class="global-card">${todo('教学日历 v3 待审核','教学秘书需要在 3 个工作日内完成审核')}${todo('第 3 章资料摘要已完成','AI 任务已生成可编辑草稿',true)}${todo('成绩导入存在 warning','4 条记录需要人工检查')}</section></main>`}
function settings(){return `<main class="global-main"><div class="eyebrow">系统设置 / SYSTEM SETTINGS</div><div class="title-row"><div><h1>系统设置</h1><p class="muted">课程级配置统一从这里维护</p></div></div><section class="global-card"><div class="head"><div><h2>校历与周次设置</h2><p class="muted">维护当前课程的学校校历、学期日期、教学周数、周学时和授课星期。</p></div><button class="btn primary" onclick="openCalendarConfig()">配置校历</button></div><p class="muted" style="margin:10px 0 0">节假日、调停课与填表审签不在教学日历页面展示；学时差异仍由教学日历保留并阻止提交审核。</p></section><section class="global-card" style="margin-top:16px"><h2>模型信息管理</h2><div class="route"><span>课程资料问答 · course_qa</span><b>Mock GPT-4o</b><small>备用：Mock Qwen</small></div><div class="route"><span>教学大纲生成 · syllabus_generate</span><b>Mock GPT-4o</b><small>备用：—</small></div></section><section class="global-card" style="margin-top:16px">${table(['模型','能力','状态','最近测试','操作'],[['Mock GPT-4o','流式 · JSON','已启用','成功 · 420ms','<button class="btn secondary" onclick="alert(\'连接测试成功 · 360ms\')">测试连接</button>'],['Mock Qwen','流式','备用','成功 · 680ms','编辑']])}</section></main>`}
function coursePage(k){const titles={overview:['课程总览','课程工作空间 / OVERVIEW','教学进度和待办集中查看'],syllabus:['教学大纲','教学大纲 / SYLLABUS','当前版本 v3 · AI 草稿需人工确认后提交审核'],calendar:['教学日历','教学日历 / CALENDAR','2026 秋季 · 共 16 周 · 32 学时'],courseware:['课件制作','课件制作 / COURSEWARE','第 3 章 · 连通性与遍历 · 5 页'],assignment:['作业管理','作业管理 / ASSIGNMENT','3 份作业 · 课件和作业不强制教学秘书审核'],students:['学生画像','学生画像 / STUDENTS','离散数学 · 50 名学生 · 数据已脱敏聚合'],exam:['试卷管理','试卷管理 / EXAM','正式试卷需教学秘书审核']}[k]||['课程总览','课程工作空间 / OVERVIEW','教学进度和待办集中查看'];let body='';if(k==='overview')body=`<div class="stats">${stat('本周教学进度','68%','↑ 12% 较上周')}${stat('章节覆盖','42 / 61','知识点已映射')}${stat('待处理事项','5','2 项即将逾期')}${stat('课程资产','28','资料 · 课件')}</div><div class="grid"><section class="panel"><div class="head"><h2>本周行动</h2></div>${todo('教学日历 v3 待审核','截止今天')}${todo('第 4 章备课草稿','继续编辑',true)}</section><section class="panel"><div class="head"><h2>最近 AI 结果</h2></div>${todo('第 3 章资料摘要','已保存 · 来源第 42–48 页',true)}<button class="btn secondary" onclick="openAI('资料摘要')">打开 AI 结果</button></section></div>`;else if(k==='syllabus')body=`<div class="split"><section class="panel"><div class="head"><h2>章节结构</h2><button class="btn primary" onclick="openAI('大纲生成')">✦ 生成大纲</button></div><div class="outline"><b>第 1 章 集合与关系</b><span>知识点 8 · 4 学时</span><b>第 2 章 图论基础</b><span>知识点 12 · 6 学时</span><b>第 3 章 连通性与遍历 <em class="tag ok">AI 草稿</em></b><span>知识点 14 · 8 学时</span></div></section><section class="panel"><h2>课程目标</h2>${todo('目标 1','理解离散结构基本概念',true)}${todo('目标 2','分析图与网络问题',true)}<button class="btn secondary">＋ 添加目标</button></section></div>`;else if(k==='preparation')body=`<div class="filter-row"><button class="btn secondary">第 3 章 · 连通性与遍历⌄</button><button class="btn primary" onclick="openAI('备课生成')">✦ 生成备课内容</button></div><div class="split"><section class="panel"><h2>重点与难点</h2><p>连通图、欧拉图与哈密顿图；判定条件对比。</p><button class="btn secondary">重新生成</button></section><section class="panel"><h2>互动问题</h2><p>让学生用邻接矩阵解释一个反例。</p><button class="btn secondary">重新生成</button></section></div>`;else if(k==='courseware')body=`<div class="cards">${['学习目标','概念导入','例题演示','课堂练习','总结与作业'].map((x,i)=>`<section class="panel"><span class="eyebrow">第 ${i+1} 页</span><h2>${x}</h2><p class="muted">AI 生成页面结构草稿</p><button class="btn secondary">重新生成</button></section>`).join('')}</div><div class="actions"><button class="btn primary">保存并确认</button><button class="btn secondary">预览课件</button></div>`;else if(k==='assignment')body=`<section class="panel"><div class="head"><h2>作业列表</h2><button class="btn primary" onclick="openAI('作业生成')">✦ 生成作业</button></div>${table(['作业名称','关联章节','题目数','状态','截止日期'],[['第 1 次作业','集合与关系','8','已发布','09-18'],['第 2 次作业','图论基础','10','已发布','10-02'],['第 3 次作业（草稿）','连通性与遍历','5','草稿','10-16']])}</section>`;else if(k==='students')body=`<div class="stats">${stat('班级均分','78.6','↑ 4.2')}${stat('及格率','86%','↑ 8%')}${stat('需关注','4','异常识别')}${stat('数据覆盖','92%','46 / 50 人')}</div><section class="panel"><div class="head"><h2>学生列表（脱敏展示）</h2><button class="btn primary" onclick="openAI('学情摘要')">✦ 生成学情摘要</button></div>${table(['学生标识','班级','综合成绩','章节掌握度','状态'],[['学生 A***21','1 班','92','91%','优秀'],['学生 B***08','1 班','78','68%','需关注'],['学生 C***34','2 班','64','52%','需关注']])}<div class="actions"><button class="btn secondary">导入成绩</button><button class="btn secondary">导出成绩</button></div></section>`;else body=`<section class="panel"><div class="head"><h2>试卷列表</h2><button class="btn primary" onclick="openAI('试卷生成')">✦ 生成试卷</button></div>${table(['试卷名称','关联版本','总分','状态','更新时间'],[['2026 秋季期中试卷','v3','100','待审核','今天 10:08'],['第 2 次单元测验','v3','50','已发布','昨天 15:20'],['期末试卷草稿','v2','100','草稿','9 月 1 日']])}<div class="actions"><button class="btn secondary">＋ 新建试卷</button><button class="btn primary">提交审核</button></div></section>`;return shell(`<div class="eyebrow">${titles[1]}</div><div class="title-row"><div><h1>${titles[0]}</h1><p class="muted">${titles[2]}</p></div></div>${body}`,k)}
function render(){let h=location.hash.slice(1)||'home';const app=document.getElementById('app');document.querySelectorAll('[data-global]').forEach(a=>a.classList.toggle('active',a.dataset.global===h.split('/')[0]));if(h==='home')app.innerHTML=home();else if(h==='courses')app.innerHTML=courses();else if(h==='materials')app.innerHTML=materials();else if(h==='notifications')app.innerHTML=notifications();else if(h==='settings')app.innerHTML=settings();else if(h.startsWith('course/'))app.innerHTML=(window.coursePage||coursePage)(h.split('/')[1]);else app.innerHTML=home()}function openAI(title){if(window.__modalCloseTimer){clearTimeout(window.__modalCloseTimer);window.__modalCloseTimer=null}document.body.classList.add('modal-lock');document.documentElement.classList.add('modal-lock');const modal=document.getElementById('modal'),bg=document.getElementById('modalBg');modal.classList.remove('create-open','closing');bg.classList.remove('create-open','closing');document.querySelector('.modal-bottom').style.display='flex';document.getElementById('modalTitle').textContent=title;document.getElementById('stream').innerHTML='<span class="status">● 流式输出中…</span><p>正在读取课程资料并生成内容<span class="cursor">▋</span></p>';modal.classList.add('open');bg.classList.add('open');setTimeout(()=>{if(modal.classList.contains('open')&&!modal.classList.contains('create-open'))document.getElementById('stream').innerHTML='<p>已生成部分结果：重点围绕图的连通性展开，建议结合教材第 42–48 页例题。</p><span class="cursor">▋</span>'},700)}function closeAI(){const modal=document.getElementById('modal'),bg=document.getElementById('modalBg'),isCreate=modal.classList.contains('create-open');if(!modal.classList.contains('open'))return;if(isCreate){if(window.__modalCloseTimer)clearTimeout(window.__modalCloseTimer);modal.classList.add('closing');bg.classList.add('closing');window.__modalCloseTimer=setTimeout(()=>{modal.classList.remove('open','create-open','closing');bg.classList.remove('open','create-open','closing');document.body.classList.remove('modal-lock');document.documentElement.classList.remove('modal-lock');window.__modalCloseTimer=null},180);return}modal.classList.remove('open','create-open','closing');bg.classList.remove('open','create-open','closing');document.body.classList.remove('modal-lock');document.documentElement.classList.remove('modal-lock')}window.addEventListener('hashchange',render);document.getElementById('modalClose').onclick=closeAI;document.getElementById('modalBg').onclick=()=>{if(!document.getElementById('modal').classList.contains('create-open'))closeAI()};document.getElementById('modalSave').onclick=()=>{alert('AI 结果已保存为草稿');closeAI()};document.getElementById('modalRetry').onclick=()=>alert('已切换备用模型并重新排队');render();
